= Track Distributions of the Selected Candidates <sec:app_tracks>
This appendix shows the tracks of the mass-window pairs after the nominal coherent and incoherent selections of @sec:candidates, with both tracks of each pair entered.
The distributions are raw reconstructed counts; no requirement beyond the nominal selections is applied.

